         <Group>
            <Season id="DisplayNonCustomaryPrayers">
               <Text>
                  <Language id="Coptic">
                     Elicabet acmici n~ous/ri: acmou] e~ pefran je Iwannyc: Za,ariac piou/b: afouwn n~rwf efhwc e~V].
                  </Language>
                  <Language id="English">
                     Elizabeth gave birth to a son, and called his name John, Zachariah the priest, opened his mouth praising God.
                  </Language>
                  <Language id="Arabic">
                     اليصابات ولدتإبن ، ودعت إسمه يوحنا ، زكريا الكاهن ، فتح فاه مسبحً الله.   
                  </Language>
               </Text>
               
               <Text>
                  <Language id="Coptic">
                     M~peouon twnf qen nijinmici: n~te nihio~mi efo~ni m~mok: n~yok ounis] qen n/eyouab t/rou Iwan/c piref]wmc.
                  </Language>
                  <Language id="English">
                     No one has risen among those born of women, who is like you, You are great among all saints, O John the Baptist.
                  </Language>
                  <Language id="Arabic">
                     لم يقم في مواليد النساء ،  من يشبهك ،  أنت عظيم في جميع القديسين ،  يا يوحنا المعمدان.  
                  </Language>
               </Text>
            </Season>
